<title>POLAND: BIG Q2 net falls to PLN 8.3 mln.</title>
<headline>BIG Q2 net falls to PLN 8.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG bank preliminary results for the second quarter of the bank's finanical year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			8.36   vs  10.87</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  8.26   vs  10.76</p>
<p>    net profit				8.26   vs  10.76</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA. The bank's financial year runs from October, 1 to September, 30.</p>
